WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.810
India passed its data protection

2
00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:03.770
law in 2023.

3
00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.869
Most of it still isn't in force.

4
00:00:06.369 --> 00:00:08.630
It gives you, the Data Principal, rights:

5
00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.497
to access your data, correct

6
00:00:10.497 --> 00:00:11.246
or erase it,

7
00:00:11.346 --> 00:00:13.458
seek redress, and nominate someone.

8
00:00:13.858 --> 00:00:15.469
Whoever decides why and how

9
00:00:15.469 --> 00:00:16.781
your data is processed

10
00:00:16.881 --> 00:00:18.305
is a Data Fiduciary, and

11
00:00:18.305 --> 00:00:19.611
owes you those duties.

12
00:00:20.011 --> 00:00:21.537
But the Act lets the government

13
00:00:21.537 --> 00:00:22.767
switch on different parts

14
00:00:22.767 --> 00:00:23.702
on different dates.

15
00:00:24.152 --> 00:00:26.584
The rules came in November 2025.

16
00:00:26.734 --> 00:00:28.137
The Data Protection Board

17
00:00:28.137 --> 00:00:29.315
part started at once.

18
00:00:29.715 --> 00:00:31.678
Consent managers come a year later.

19
00:00:31.828 --> 00:00:33.833
Most duties, after 18 months:

20
00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.811
around May 2027.

21
00:00:36.261 --> 00:00:37.455
The rights are written.

22
00:00:37.655 --> 00:00:39.191
The rules set the clock.

23
00:00:39.691 --> 00:00:40.587
Your turn.

24
00:00:40.887 --> 00:00:42.509
Who is a Data Fiduciary?
